        "original_id": "1bfd42f6-2e40-59c0-8bde-1fb7b0df4e05",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- TV Shows: Punchlines, Eye Guess, The Val Doonican Show, The Comedians\n- People: Bill Cullen, Paul Melba, Russ Abbot, Lennie Bennett, Stan Boardman, Jim Bowen, Jimmy Bright, Duggie Brown, Mike Burton, Jimmy Jones, Dave Butler, Brian Carroll, Frank Carson, Mike Coyne, Jimmy Cricket, Colin Crompton, Pauline Daniels, Charlie Daze, Vince Earl, Steve Faye, Eddie Flanagan, Stu Francis, Ken Goodwin, Jackie Hamilton, Jerry Harris, George King, Bobby Knutt, Bernard Manning, Mike McCabe, Mick Miller, Hal Nolan, Tom O'Connor, Tom Pepper, Bryn Phillips, Mike Reid, George Roper, Harry Scott, Sammy Thomas, Johnny Wager, Roy Walker, Charlie Williams, Lee Wilson, Lenny Windsor\n- Roles: game show host, comedian\n\nFacts:\n- Eye Guess was an American game show that originally ran from 1966 to 1969.\n- The show Punchlines was based on a failed 1979 American game show pilot of the same name.\n- Bill Cullen hosted the 1979 American game show pilot Punchlines.\n- The 1979 pilot Punchlines was a reboot of Eye Guess.\n- Bill Cullen hosted 23 shows over the course of his career.\n- Bill Cullen was best known as a game show host and earned the nickname \"Dean of Game Show Hosts.\"\n- Paul Melba made television appearances on Punchlines and on eight editions of The Val Doonican Show.\n- The 1971 TV series The Comedians featured nightclub and working men's club comedians including Paul Melba, Russ Abbot, Lennie Bennett, Stan Boardman, Jim Bowen, Jimmy Bright, Duggie Brown, Mike Burton, Jimmy Jones, Dave Butler, Brian Carroll, Frank Carson, Mike Coyne, Jimmy Cricket, Colin Crompton, Pauline Daniels, Charlie Daze, Vince Earl, Steve Faye, Eddie Flanagan, Stu Francis, Ken Goodwin, Jackie Hamilton, Jerry Harris, George King, Bobby Knutt, Bernard Manning, Mike McCabe, Mick Miller, Hal Nolan, Tom O'Connor, Tom Pepper, Bryn Phillips, Mike Reid, George Roper, Harry Scott, Sammy Thomas, Johnny Wager, Roy Walker, Charlie Williams, Lee Wilson, and Lenny Windsor.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
